<h2>How to add a submenu</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Create a <code>.links.menu.yml</code> entry in your custom module with parent <code>bm_main.bluemarloc_admin</code>.</li>
  <li>Provide a route in <code>.routing.yml</code> that points to your form or controller.</li>
  <li>Clear caches with <code>drush cr</code>.</li>
</ol>

<h2>Tips</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Use <code>weight</code> to control order.</li>
  <li>Pick the right subsection for clarity.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Existing Blue Marloc menu parents (bm_main.links.menu.yml)</h2>
<ul>
  <li><code>bm_main.bluemarloc</code> — Top-level container (/admin)</li>
  <li><code>bm_main.bluemarloc_admin</code> — Administration</li>
  <li><code>bm_main.bluemarloc_entity</code> — Entity</li>
  <li><code>bm_main.bluemarloc_data</code> — Data production</li>
  <li><code>bm_main.bluemarloc_enhancements</code> — Enhancements</li>
  <li><code>bm_main.bluemarloc_manager</code> — Management</li>
  <li><code>bm_main.bluemarloc_developer</code> — Development</li>
  <li><code>bm_main.bluemarloc_developer_tools</code> — Reports (under Development)</li>
</ul>
